    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a new line of robot that has been sent to an alien world to prepare it for human colonization. The AI corporations organizing the endeavor are struggling to maintain control. They've faced complications ranging from aggressive native species to the failures and betrayals of certain former employees. We hope you will do better.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472230/extras/111fcd0acba7f7a5023e197f8490aefb.poster.avif?t=1744840085\" width=540 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472230/extras/111fcd0acba7f7a5023e197f8490aefb.webm?t=1744840085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472230/extras/111fcd0acba7f7a5023e197f8490aefb.mp4?t=1744840085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect over 90 abilities to customize your robot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight massive armies of enormous creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy 1 hour of cool beats while you work</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid destroying destructible buildings (optional)</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a new line of robot that has been sent to an alien world to prepare it for human colonization. The AI corporations organizing the endeavor are struggling to maintain control. They've faced complications ranging from aggressive native species to the failures and betrayals of certain former employees. We hope you will do better.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472230/extras/111fcd0acba7f7a5023e197f8490aefb.poster.avif?t=1744840085\" width=540 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472230/extras/111fcd0acba7f7a5023e197f8490aefb.webm?t=1744840085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472230/extras/111fcd0acba7f7a5023e197f8490aefb.mp4?t=1744840085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect over 90 abilities to customize your robot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight massive armies of enormous creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy 1 hour of cool beats while you work</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid destroying destructible buildings (optional)</p></li></ul>",
